OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in collision involving
OL,4,Afour vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been killed in a collision
OL,7,Fwhich involved four cars.
OL,9,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said it
OL,10,Fwas called to London Road in
OL,11,FShrewsbury, Shropshire, shortly after
OL,12,F11:00 BST. One of the cars was on its
OL,13,Froof, it said.
OL,15,FThe driver, a man in his 60s, was
OL,16,Fconfirmed dead at the scene by
OL,17,Fparamedics. Two further patients, a
OL,18,Fwoman and a girl, were treated for
OL,19,Fminor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
