OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed in collision involving
OL,4,Afour vehicles
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Mercia Police said it appeared two
OL,7,Fof the cars had been parked and
OL,8,Funattended. Road closures were in place
OL,9,Fand police expected the closures to
OL,10,Fremain for some time. The police force
OL,11,Fhas asked anyone who might have
OL,12,Fwitnessed the crash to get in touch.
